  {
   "text": "Five Ravnica Allegiance Guild Kits were released on February 15, 2019, three weeks after the release of the set .",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Each Guild Kit features a 60-card preconstructed theme deck flavored after one of the featured guilds, combining cards from every Ravnica set released so far. The reprints won't be Standard legal . The Kits are packaged with an official guild pin, a guild sticker, a spindown life counter and an insert with mission instructions.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "All legendary cards in the Guild Kits have the legendary card frame , and the premium foil face cards of the decks ( Isperia, Supreme Judge , Rakdos, Lord of Riots , Ruric Thar, the Unbowed , Zegana, Utopian Speaker and Teysa, Orzhov Scion ) feature alternate art .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "The expansion symbol for each deck is a miniature of the corresponding guild symbol . The decks feature basic lands , with a design of the text box especially tailored to the appropriate guild. Foil versions of these lands were given out at the Ravnica Weekend .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
